{"id":"e19f0e19237e8dee","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-parity-p.md","title":"Parity-P and the Parity Quantifier","display":"df-parity-p — Parity-P and the Parity Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-parity-p","aliases":["28-df-parity-p"],"display":"df-parity-p — Parity-P and the Parity Quantifier","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 17.15–17.16 and §17.4.2","source_printed_pages":"352–353,355–356","source_pdf_pages":"378–379,381–382","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-parity-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-parity-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parity-p — Parity-P and the Parity Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 17.15–17.16 and §17.4.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"352–353,355–356"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"378–379,381–382"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的确定型多项式时间函数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\)</span> 为非负整数系数证书长度界。</li>\n<li>多输入调用采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_2\\)</span> 编码，单比特串与其数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 认同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\">\\(\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\)</span> 为下式定义的二元一比特输出验证器集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\">\\(V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi:\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\phi:\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{V\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{V\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\oplus y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\phi(y)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\phi(y)\\equiv1\\pmod2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\oplus y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\phi(y)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\phi(y)\\equiv1\\pmod2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\\mathrm P\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}V(x,y)\\equiv1\\pmod2]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\oplus\\mathrm P\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}V(x,y)\\equiv1\\pmod2]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与NP的存在证书不同，此处要求接受证书数为奇数；精确长度和配对模型均已绑定。教材的⊕SAT是将此量词作用于公式赋值集的特例。没有声称奇数计数等价唯一证书。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 17.15–17.16 and §17.4.2；印刷页 352–353,355–356；PDF 页 378–379,381–382。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第17章的 Parity-P and the Parity Quantifier，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 为 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的确定型多项式时间函数集；$p\\in\\mathbb N[t]$ 为非负整数系数证书长度界。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"多输入调用采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的 $\\operatorname{tup}_2$ 编码，单比特串与其数值 $0,1$ 认同；$\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}$ 为下式定义的二元一比特输出验证器集合，$V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}$。$m\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\phi:\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N[t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_2","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi:\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\coloneqq\\{V\\in\\mathbf{FP}:\\forall x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\oplus y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\phi(y)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^m}\\phi(y)\\equiv1\\pmod2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\oplus\\mathrm P\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ \\exists V\\in\\mathcal V_{\\oplus}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}V(x,y)\\equiv1\\pmod2]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2187,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-permanent]]、[[28-df-cycle-cover]]、[[28-lem-permanent-cycle-cover]]、[[28-df-parity-p]]。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}